{"unit_id":"tag:0FPI:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）的复形（complex）。图式（diagram）\n<MATH_0004>\n来自复形（complexes）上的 <MATH_0005>、复形（complexes）上的 <MATH_0006> 及伴随（adjunction）<MATH_0007>，它在 <MATH_0008> 中可交换（commutes）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"伴随对应态射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"给定复形"},{"source_term":"diagram","target_term":"图式","context":"伴随相容图式"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"复形层面的构造"},{"source_term":"adjunction","target_term":"伴随","context":"导出伴随"},{"source_term":"commutes","target_term":"可交换","context":"导出范畴中的交换性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0FPI:proof","translation":"使用 K-平坦（K-flat）分解（resolutions）和 K-内射（injective）分解（resolutions）的存在，见引理 <REF_0001>、<REF_0002>、<REF_0003> 及上文讨论。选取拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）\n<MATH_0001>\n其中 <MATH_0002> 作为 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）的复形（complex）为 K-内射（injective）的。选取拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0004>，其中 <MATH_0005> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0006>-模（modules）组成，各项（terms）平坦（flat）。可选取 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex），由 <MATH_0007>-模（modules）组成，记为 <MATH_0008>，各项（terms）平坦（flat），并选取复形（complexes）的态射（morphisms）的图式（diagram）\n<MATH_0009>\n在同伦（homotopy）意义下可交换（commutative），其中顶部水平的（horizontal）箭头（arrow）为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）。具体而言，可先为某个复形（complex）<MATH_0010> 选取这样的图式（diagram），因为拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms）在复形（complexes）的同伦范畴（homotopy category）中构成乘法系（multiplicative system）；然后可选取 <MATH_0011> 的分解（resolution），由 K-平坦（K-flat）复形（complex）给出，各项（terms）平坦（flat）。取拉回（pullbacks），得到复形（complexes）的态射（morphisms）的图式（diagram）\n<MATH_0012>\n在同伦（homotopy）意义下可交换（commutative）。外部矩形（rectangle）见证了本引理陈述的正确性。\n","allowed_english":["K"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"resolutions","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_ter