{"unit_id":"tag:0B6C:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环拓扑斯的态射（morphism of ringed topoi）。<MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003> 的伴随性（adjointness）使我们能构造相对杯积（relative cup product）\n<MATH_0004>\n在 <MATH_0005> 中，对所有 <MATH_0006>（属于 <MATH_0007>）均如此。具体而言，此映射（map）伴随于（adjoint）映射（map）<MATH_0008>；可取它为同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0009>\n（引理 <REF_0001>）与映射（map）\n<MATH_0010>\n的复合（composition），后者来自余单位（counit）<MATH_0011>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"counit","target_term":"余单位"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of ringed topoi","target_term":"赋环拓扑斯的态射","context":"杯积对应的态射"},{"source_term":"adjointness","target_term":"伴随性","context":"导出伴随关系"},{"source_term":"relative cup product","target_term":"相对杯积","context":"构造的运算"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"杯积及其伴随映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随于","context":"构造杯积的伴随关系"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"拉回与张量的同构"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"确定伴随映射的复合"},{"source_term":"counit","target_term":"余单位","context":"伴随余单位"}],"notes":[]}
